l,"closed_at":null},"comments":21,"created_at":"2024-11-23T03:40:36Z","updated_at":"2026-03-05T16:10:27Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99572","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99572","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99572.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99572.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Replaces the resampling procedure in `AudioStreamWAV` load with a `libsamplerate` resample, using its Medium Sinc Interpolator. Only on editor builds.\r\n\r\nInstead of using a fast interpolation algorithm like Cubic, it uses the second best resampler that exists in the world of open-source. High-frequency sounds on lower sample rates should become slightly less silent.\r\n\r\nThe initial version of the PR used Sinc Best, but was replaced due to being [too heavy and slow compared to the others](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99572#issuecomment-2495471749), [the gain being not that great compared to Medium](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99572#issuecomment-2495535830). Sinc Medium is used instead.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99572/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99572/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}